  "description": "Superb Renovated 2-Bedroom Cottage with Spacious Home Office | Dublin 8\n\nThis superb mid-terrace cottage, featuring two bedrooms plus a separate generous sized home office with Velux window, has recently been renovated and is ready for immediate occupation. Ideally located in the heart of Dublin 8, the property sits in a quiet, mature cul-de-sac just a stone’s throw from the new Children’s Hospital, Rialto LUAS stop and Rialto Village.\n\nThe two bedrooms and home office are all of similar size, with the home office room featuring a Velux window instead of a traditional window.\n\nUpon entering, you are greeted by a large, bright living room featuring a new sash window, high ceiling, vertical radiator and laminate flooring. The room includes a brick fireplace with TV wall bracket above and a cosy reading nook to the side. It is furnished with a sofa, 1.5-seater armchair and shelving.\n\nTo the right of the living room is the first double bedroom, which also benefits from a new sash window, high ceiling, laminate flooring and vertical radiator. The room is furnished with a double bed, large wardrobe/chest of drawers and bedside locker.\n\nAlso accessed from the living room is the home office, which is similarly proportioned and finished with laminate flooring and a high ceiling. A Velux rooflight provides natural light, while the room is furnished with a desk, chair, shelving and tall storage unit.\n\nTo the rear is the bright open-plan kitchen and dining area, featuring a vertical radiator, dining table and chairs, and ample counter, cupboard and storage space. The room is filled with natural light from the large Velux rooflight and glazed rear door, which provides access to the south-west-facing patio.\n\nThe fully tiled bathroom is located at the rear of the property and includes a shower, window, extractor fan, radiator and wall heater.\n\nThe second double bedroom, also situated to the rear, features laminate flooring, stylish wall panelling and excellent natural light. It is furnished with a double bed, tall wardrobe/shelving unit and bedside chest of drawers.\n\nExternally, the property benefits from a private south-west-facing patio, ideal for enjoying afternoon and evening sunshine. On-street permit parking is available.\n\nKey Features:\n- Recently renovated throughout\n- Two double bedrooms\n- Separate home office\n- Bright and spacious living accommodation\n- High ceilings\n- New sash windows\n- Open-plan kitchen/dining room\n- South-west-facing rear patio\n- Fully furnished\n- Quiet mature cul-de-sac\n- Excellent location in Dublin 8\n- Close to the Children’s Hospital\n- Short walk to Rialto LUAS stop and Rialto Village\n- On-street permit parking\n- Available for immediate occupation",
